[gd_scene load_steps=18 format=3]

; M3-BPR-01: the drowned tower of the Underway (Ch1 C1-04/C1-06: the wickfry, the oil slug, the limpet randoms),
; underwater, greybox until env-art's lamp-diver sea-floor kit lands (M3-ENV-05/06). Color script "Ch1" note: only
; Rhen's oil lamp and held cyan motes. A dark deep_teal_shadow world with heavy fog in place of the underwater post
; (docs/kb/tech/underwater.md; no UnderwaterRig in a battle scene yet), a dim filtered light from far above as the
; Sun, the oil_lamp point (#FFB16E) by the party carrying the frame, and a few held-cyan (#7FC6D9) points sinking
; among the gallery's pillars behind the foes. A flat gallery floor at y = 0; no Sea (there is no surface in view).

